{"from": "passage:mk-10-31", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-19-30", "note": "The same first/last saying; Mark gives the halves in the opposite order: 'many who are first will be last; and the last first'."}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-32", "type": "asserts", "to": "claim:mt-20-17-18-going-up-jerusalem"}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-32", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-20-17", "note": "Going up to Jerusalem; Mark adds that Jesus walked ahead of them and that the followers were amazed and afraid."}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-33", "type": "asserts", "to": "claim:mt-20-17-18-going-up-jerusalem"}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-33", "type": "asserts", "to": "claim:mt-20-18-condemned-by-chief-priests"}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-33", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-20-18", "note": "The same prediction: delivered to the chief priests and scribes, condemned to death, delivered to the Gentiles."}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-34", "type": "asserts", "to": "claim:mt-20-19-mocked-scourged-crucified"}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-34", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-20-19", "note": "Mark: mock, spit on, scourge, kill, rise on the third day; Matthew: mock, flog, crucify, rise."}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-35", "type": "asserts", "to": "claim:mk-10-35-sons-request"}
{"from": "passage:mk-10-35", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-20-20", "note": "The same request for the seats of honor: Matthew tells it as made by the mother of the sons of Zebedee with her sons, Mark by the two themselves."}
